    "rawHtml": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>PulseLogix | Premier Logistics Solutions</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\" />\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;600;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />\n</head>\n\n<body>\n  <header class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"logo\">Pulse<span>Logix</span></div>\n    <nav class=\"navbar\">\n      <ul>\n        <li><a href=\"#home\">Home</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#services\">Services</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#testimonials\">Testimonials</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </nav>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"hero\" id=\"home\">\n    <div class=\"hero-content\">\n      <h1>Modern Logistics with Human Pulse</h1>\n      <p>From first mile to last, we deliver with precision and care.</p>\n      <a href=\"#services\" class=\"btn\">Discover More</a>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"services\" id=\"services\">\n    <h2>Our Logistics Expertise</h2>\n    <div class=\"services-grid\">\n      <div class=\"service-card\">\n        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1578926288028-7b1c5d542e5f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80\" alt=\"Delivery Truck\">\n        <h3>Express Shipping</h3>\n        <p>Fast and secure express delivery for urgent freight and time-sensitive goods.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"service-card\">\n        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1602848596821-8c1d6c04674f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80\" alt=\"Warehouse\">\n        <h3>Smart Warehousing</h3>\n        <p>Automated inventory systems and adaptive storage designed to grow with you.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"service-card\">\n        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1579165468335-0a4ce43f7815?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80\" alt=\"Customs\">\n        <h3>Customs & Compliance</h3>\n        <p>Streamlined cross-border documentation, clearance, and regulation support.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"service-card\">\n        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599058917212-d7500890f0a8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80\" alt=\"Tech\">\n        <h3>Logistics Intelligence</h3>\n        <p>Real-time analytics, AI-driven tracking, and predictive delivery optimization.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"testimonials\" id=\"testimonials\">\n    <h2>What Our Clients Say</h2>\n    <div class=\"testimonial-grid\">\n      <div class=\"testimonial\">\n        <p>“PulseLogix has revolutionized how we move goods across regions. They’re fast, reliable, and forward-thinking.”</p>\n        <h4>— Horizon Group</h4>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"testimonial\">\n        <p>“Their warehousing automation cut our storage costs by 40% in just 6 months. Amazing tech.”</p>\n        <h4>— Quantum Supply</h4>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"testimonial\">\n        <p>“Cross-border compliance used to be a nightmare. Now it’s seamless. Can’t recommend them enough.”</p>\n        <h4>— Apex Imports</h4>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"testimonial\">\n        <p>“They’re not just a provider—they’re a partner. PulseLogix supports us through every delivery cycle.”</p>\n        <h4>— Zenith Retail</h4>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer class=\"footer\" id=\"contact\">\n    <div class=\"footer-top\">\n      <div>\n        <h3>Contact Us</h3>\n        <p>Email: hello@pulselogix.com</p>\n        <p>Phone: +1-833-PULSE</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h3>Stay Updated</h3>\n        <form id=\"newsletter-form\">\n          <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" placeholder=\"Enter your email\" required />\n          <button type=\"submit\">Join</button>\n          <p class=\"error\"></p>\n        </form>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"footer-note\">© 2025 PulseLogix. All rights reserved.</p>\n  </footer>\n\n  <script>\n    const form = document.getElementById('newsletter-form');\n    const email = document.getElementById('email');\n    const error = document.querySelector('.error');\n\n    form.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {\n      const pattern = /^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/;\n      if (!pattern.test(email.value)) {\n        e.preventDefault();\n        error.textContent = 'Please enter a valid email address.';\n      } else {\n        error.textContent = '';\n      }\n    });\n  </script>\n</body>\n\n</html>"
